  "description": "Kwon Si-Jun, a man who was adopted from the illegitimate child of Daeseo Group. And Sa In-Seo, a woman who is the sinner in this family.\n\n\"Have you ever thought that I was pitiful?\"\n\"You've always been pitiful. But even if you're pitiful... what can't be done can't be done. You have to be punished.\" In-Seo, who had been enduring\n\n17 years of long-term abuse using her alexithymia as a shield, finally decides to break free after hearing a single word from Si-Jun , whom she considered her only support. \n\n\"You're the only one who doesn't know that I'm crazy about you. It's always been like this.\"\n\nHowever, Si-Jun reveals incomprehensible emotions to In-Seo and makes demands as she tries to escape his grasp. But In-Seo can no longer trust Kwon Si-Jun. No matter what kind of love he confesses.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \nR19: [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=12755637)   \nR15: [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=12755632)",
